## What's Changed?
### Paper
You can now do some economy stuff with Vault and provide some safety checks to stop exploits (NaN abuse, etc.)

### Paper, Velocity
Paper and Velocity SQDLib now have separate jars you can depend on, so you don't have to shadow it into your plugin. Of course, that comes with the downside that you can't mix versions of SQDLib with plugins and thus from package changes to break the whole plugin.


**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/SQD-Studios/sqd-lib/compare/v3.1.1...v3.2.0

